      "description": "Gol and Maia's Precursor robot, the final boss. Needs its alt-actor links (4 yellow eco and the blue vent, or it writes through empty links) and the Final Boss Sage for the light eco ending. A level patch (subtypes/robotboss.gc) puts the yellow shot and the light eco at the boss's height. Its looping sounds (charge buzz, red buzz, blue loop) fade out 80 m from its origin: vanilla fights within about 20 m of it (the 4 yellow eco 11 m around, the blue vent 20 m).",
