      "description": "Spawns a vanilla particle group (waterfalls, steam, torches, bubbles, moths ...) at its position, optionally with a sound. Pick the vanilla particle file (its code is added to the level) and a group from it; every vanilla group uses the always-loaded 'effects' textures, so they work with any texture source. Rotation has no effect. Reacts to 'stop / 'start (e.g. from a warp gate switch). Some splash / drip groups cut off at vanilla heights.",
