      "description": "Red / blue / yellow sage in his energy cage (the cage is a child with solid collision; Jak can stand on it). The game task picks the task control (vanilla citadel-sage-<colour>). Before he's freed: idles, ambient lines, and talking plays his '<colour>sage-resolution' cutscene (drops the cage bars; repeatable, nothing closes). 'open (a broken Citadel Generator's open actor) drops the bars. Collecting the task's cell sends 'play-anim to the process named '<colour>-sagecage-1' (hard-coded in the cell code), which plays the cutscene; afterwards the task is complete and he fires his beam at the linked target forever. Hidden once vanilla citadel-sage-green is fully done. Name the object so it exports as <colour>-sagecage-1.",
