      "shape": "CUBE",
      "reacts_to": [
        "shield-off",
        "shield-on",
        "die"
      ],
      "description": "The giant robot in the Citadel centre, behind its shield; head, guns, arms etc. are 8 extra animated parts from the same art group. It is solid: collision mesh, sphere about 35 m centred 20 m up. Touching it zaps and shoves Jak (2 m up, 3 m back), even with the shield off. Shield on: shield particles, 'robotcage-lp' hum audible to 150 m, palette-fade control 7 forced to 1. 'shield-off / 'shield-on toggle the shield; 'die removes it. It removes itself at spawn when its game task's status is invalid, so task none means it never appears.",
      "panels": [
        {
          "panel": "game-task",
          "description": "Required: it deletes itself if this task's status is invalid (none, or a task already fully closed). Vanilla: citadel-sage-green (it goes away once the green sage is freed).",
